  "notes": "'Factor' column used with Factor Code F (fee schedule). Factor Code M with 0.00 (manual pricing) recorded in by_report: D6059, D6065, D6066, D7953. Single schedule, no age split. Per-code Eff Date varies: diagnostic/preventive codes 03/01/2026 (5.874% D&P increase, SPA IA-26-0002), restorative/prosthetic/sedation mostly 07/01/2025, periodontal/oral surgery many 07/01/2013; effective_date field = latest per-code date. Page says 'Open Fee Schedules (Updated October 2026)'. Same data in X04.xml. Most Iowa Medicaid members get dental through the Dental Wellness Plan / Hawki dental PAHPs (managed care); this is the FFS schedule. Listing does not imply coverage (adult implants etc. subject to criteria).",
